Description: FlickOS live installer (Calamares configuration)
 Calamares settings, branding and launcher for installing FlickOS from the
 live session, plus the live-session menu with an "Install FlickOS" entry.
 .
 Based on calamares-settings-debian. The installer removes this package from
 the installed system.
